On March 2, Ukrainian air defense systems shot down russian missiles flying over the Southern Railway Station, which flew in the directions of the Ministry of Defense.
On March 14, the wreckage of the occupiers' downhill was squandered the house and trolleybus on Kurenivka in Kyiv
On March 18, a russian missile hit a residential area on Vynohradar, from which one person was killed, another 19 people were injured, including four children.
On March 21, russian missiles completely destroyed a modern Retroville shopping center on Vynohradar, killing at least 4 people.
