Details: Enemy continues the creation of an offensive group of troops for actions in the Slobozhansky direction.
Probably in the coming days, the occupiers will try to resume the offensive.
In addition, the enemy continues to train and send personnel, armaments and technicians to participate in hostilities on the territory of Ukraine.
Arizards and military equipment are being prepared at the point of permanent deployment of the 60th Separate Motorized Rifle Brigade (Monastery) of the 5th Combined Arms Army of the Eastern Military District.
Probably, these weapons will be moved to the temporarily occupied territory of the Donetsk region.
Also in order to restore the losses of the personnel of the units of the battalion tactical group from the 36th Separate Motorized Rifle Brigade (Borzia, Zabaykal Krai) of the 29th Combined Arms Army of the Eastern Military Corrugandoliar Army of the Eastern Military Corunion, a set of servicemen is carried out.
The enemy feels a special problem when completing the positions of drivers and me mechanics-drivers.
Departure of the selected personnel from the point of permanent deployment is planned for the second half of April of this year.
Presumably, the enemy, in order to disrupt the supply of goods to the places of hostilities, will continue strikes on transport infrastructure facilities on the territory of Ukraine in order to destroy or disfit.
Determined subdivisions of the Armed Forces of the Republic of Belarus continue to perform the task of strengthening the protection of the Ukrainian-Belarusian border in the Brest and Gomel regions.
In the Slobozhansky direction, certain units from the 6th Combined Arms Army and the coastal troops of the Northern Fleet continue the partial blockade of the city of Kharkiv, artillery shelling of certain districts of the city.
In Izyum direction, aerial reconnaissance of the area continues in order to identify the positions of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.
To do this, the enemy uses UAV "Orlan-10".
To two battalion tactical groups, the enemy tried to carry out an offensive in the directions of Dovhenke and Dmytrivka settlements, had no success and withdrew to previously occupied positions.
In the Donetsk direction, the main efforts continue to focus their main efforts on separating the settlements of Popasna, Rubizhne, Nyzhne and Novobakhmutivka, as well as establishing full control over the city of Mariupol.
The enepreciate tried to carry out assault operations in the Zolote area, was unsuccessful.
The occupiers continue their assault operations in the areas of the Azovströstal plant and a seaport.
By the forces of individual units, the enemy carried out artillery attacks on the positions of Ukrainian troops in the areas of Vysokopillia, Trudolyubivka and Marianske.
On the territory of the Donetsk and Luhansk regions, the defenders of Ukraine repulsed four enemy attacks over the past day, destroyed five tanks, eight armored units, six units of automotive equipment and eight enemy artillery systems.
